      "snippet": {
        "line": 426,
        "text": "`noncomputable def nonbarPart (f : State → ℂ) (z : State) : ℂ := f z - mean f z.1`, with `State = ℝ × Plane` and `mean f U = coefficient f U 0 = torusMean (fun Y => f (U, Y))` (`mean_eq_integral`); docstring: 'Remove the actual full torus mean at each fixed radial coordinate.'"
